      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/north_high_shoals_georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the 1800s, North High Shoals served as a key stop on Georgia’s early postal and stagecoach routes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/north_high_shoals_georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Georgia General Assembly incorporated North High Shoals as a town in 1933.",
